            <title>[LU-20663] rustreapi: lsp_stripe_pattern union breaks build against master lustreapi.h</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20663</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;rustreapi does not compile against the current master lustreapi.h.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-16518" title="Fix Clang build errors" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-16518"&gt;LU-16518&lt;/a&gt; ("utils: fix enum conversion errors in lfs", commit 0a68ef925f) turned&lt;br/&gt;
llapi_stripe_param.lsp_stripe_pattern into a member of an anonymous union:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    struct llapi_stripe_param {&lt;br/&gt;
            unsigned long long      lsp_stripe_size;&lt;br/&gt;
            char                    *lsp_pool;&lt;br/&gt;
            int                     lsp_stripe_offset;&lt;br/&gt;
            union &lt;/p&gt;
{
                    enum lov_pattern        lsp_stripe_pattern;
                    enum lmv_hash_type      lsp_hash_type;
            }
&lt;p&gt;;&lt;br/&gt;
            ...&lt;br/&gt;
    };&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;bindgen therefore emits the field as __bindgen_anon_1.lsp_stripe_pattern, and&lt;br/&gt;
rustreapi/rustreapi/src/lib.rs:240 no longer builds:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    error&lt;span class="error"&gt;&amp;#91;E0609&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;: no field `lsp_stripe_pattern` on type `lustreapi_sys::llapi_stripe_param`&lt;br/&gt;
       --&amp;gt; rustreapi/src/lib.rs:240:35&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class='table-wrap'&gt;
&lt;table class='confluenceTable'&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    240 |             addr_of_mut!((*param).lsp_stripe_pattern).write(self.stripe_pattern);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class='table-wrap'&gt;
&lt;table class='confluenceTable'&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class='confluenceTd'&gt;                                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ unknown field&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;p&gt;This is masked today because rustreapi is not wired into the Lustre build at&lt;br/&gt;
all &amp;#8211; nothing outside rustreapi/ references it except MAINTAINERS &amp;#8211; so&lt;br/&gt;
lustreapi-sys' bindgen picks up the installed /usr/include/lustre/lustreapi.h&lt;br/&gt;
from lustre-devel rather than the tree's. Build containers currently ship&lt;br/&gt;
lustre-devel 2.17.53, which predates the union. It will break as soon as the&lt;br/&gt;
devel RPMs catch up to master.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reproducer, from a master work tree:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    podman run --rm -v &amp;lt;tree&amp;gt;:/src:Z -w /src/rustreapi \&lt;br/&gt;
        -e BINDGEN_EXTRA_CLANG_ARGS="-I/src/include -I/src/include/uapi" \&lt;br/&gt;
        -e CFLAGS="-I/src/include -I/src/include/uapi" \&lt;br/&gt;
        &amp;lt;builder image&amp;gt; cargo check -p rustreapi&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Fix is to write through the anonymous union member, keeping lsp_hash_type&lt;br/&gt;
reachable for the LMV case.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Found while testing &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/58514" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/58514&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18842" title="lustreapi: add a volatile function that supports layouts" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18842"&gt;LU-18842&lt;/a&gt;), which is unrelated to this bug.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
